 .SH CUSTOMIZATION
 dwm is customized by creating a custom config.h and (re)compiling the source
 code. This keeps it fast, secure and simple.
+.P
+The root window property
+.B _DWM_KEYS
+is read again when it changes.
+An empty value, or deleting the property, restores the compiled key table.
+Each line is one directive.
+.B modkey
+followed by a modifier mask
+.RB ( "modkey Mod4Mask" )
+rewrites every compiled binding and mouse button that used MODKEY.
+.B bind
+adds or replaces one chord
+.RB ( "bind Mod4Mask XK_j focusstack 1" ).
+.B spawn
+takes the rest of the line as its argument vector.
+.BR view ,
+.BR tag ,
+.BR toggleview ,
+and
+.B toggletag
+take a tag mask such as 1, 2, 4, or ~0.
+.B setlayout
+takes a layout index or
+.BR toggle .
+.B unbind
+removes one chord, matched after
+.B modkey
+has been applied.
+.B grab
+grabs a chord and runs nothing, so the focused client does not see the key.
+A chord the table already owns is left alone.
 .SH SEE ALSO
 .BR dmenu (1),
 .BR st (1)
